      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Mandrake plants are magical humanoid roots that scream lethally when
        uprooted - people must wear earmuffs to handle them safely! These temperamental
        plants are crucial ingredients in healing potions, especially for curing
        petrification, and their effectiveness increases with age, making them the
        wizarding world''s most dangerous yet valuable botanical drama queens. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
